# Runtime state and secrets must never be committed (review round-5 hygiene):
# bare epoch-ms files (legacy state-file leak), sqlite stores and journals, HMAC key files.
# Runtime-state patterns are ROOT-ANCHORED: an unanchored console-state* also matched
# test/console-state.test.ts and silently dropped 8 tests from clone/archive recovery.
# (.env and key/db suffix patterns stay unanchored on purpose: secret shapes must be
# ignored at any depth.)
/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.hmac.key
/console-state.json
/console-state.db
/audit.jsonl
